;; cljc splices :paths into *load-path*, walking up from the cwd to find this
;; file (same rule clj and bb use), so `cljc test.clj` and an nREPL started
;; anywhere in the tree both resolve (require '[porch.tid]). Only :paths is
;; honoured — cljc has no Maven/git resolver, so :deps here would be inert.
;;
;; The :jolt alias is for bin/porch-jolt: bb/ has the shim for cljc's natives,
;; jolt/ the two pure-Clojure libraries jolt doesn't bundle (see jolt/README.md).
;; cljc never reads :aliases, so it stays on plain src/.
{:paths ["src"]
 :aliases {:jolt {:extra-paths ["bb" "jolt"]}}}
